{"id":"novi-sad","name":"诺维萨德","en":"Novi Sad","country":"Serbia","lat":45.2644,"lng":19.8317,"dek":"多瑙河畔的巴洛克老城，塞尔维亚人的雅典。","history":"诺维萨德于1694年奠基，当时的统治者是尤津·冯·萨佛伊。城市的建筑以巴洛克风格为主。城市的主要景点是彼得罗瓦拉丁要塞，建于1692至1780年之间，整个建筑过程长达一个多世纪。这座城堡在当时是抗击土耳其军队的主要集结地与防御要塞。\n\n一战前诺维萨德为奥匈帝国的一部分。一战结束后，城市被并入南斯拉夫王国的前身塞尔维亚人、克罗地亚人和斯洛文尼亚人王国。二战中诺维萨德被匈牙利占领，战后成为南斯拉夫社会主义联邦共和国的一部分。\n\n1999年科索沃战争中，诺维萨德遭受北约长达78天的轰炸。多瑙河上的所有桥梁，城市中的所有广播机构以及提炼厂房全部被摧毁。战后6年时间，跨越多瑙河的交通都由一座浮桥维持。多瑙河上的船只只能在每周固定的三次开放时间通过诺维萨德。2005年10月11日，“自由桥”投入使用，这才使多瑙河的交通重新畅通。","culture":"诺维萨德是一个重要的大学城，有“塞尔维亚人的雅典”之称。城市中心规模不大，但保存着迷人的旧建筑，主要的步行街是Dunavska街和Zmaj Jovina街，后者包含主广场（Trg slobode）。多瑙河畔的步道绵延约5公里，步道中段有一个献给二战期间突袭遇难者的广场，可以坐在那里眺望河对岸的彼得罗瓦拉丁要塞。\n\n城市获得了2022年“欧洲文化之都”和2019年“欧洲青年之都”的称号。每年夏天，彼得罗瓦拉丁要塞的战壕与城墙内会举办Exit音乐节。","pull":"一座从未被敌人攻陷的要塞，俯瞰着一座反复重建的城市。","sights":[{"name":"彼得罗瓦拉丁要塞","orig":"Petrovaradinska tvrđava","intro":"一座从未被敌人攻陷的要塞，建于1692至1780年间，历时近一个世纪。如今每年夏天在战壕与城墙内举办Exit音乐节。要塞是俯瞰诺维萨德的最佳位置，日落时尤佳。钟楼上的时针与分针故意颠倒，让远处的人更容易看清小时。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0b/Dejan-Valek-Petrovaradinska_tvrdjava-2019.JPG-2.jpg/960px-Dejan-Valek-Petrovaradinska_tvrdjava-2019.JPG-2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":625},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%BD%BC%E5%BE%97%E7%BE%85%E7%93%A6%E6%8B%89%E4%B8%81%E8%A6%81%E5%A1%9E"},{"name":"市政厅","orig":"Gradska kuća","intro":"位于诺维萨德主广场Trg Slobode上，是当地人默认的会面地点。广场周边集中了数处值得一看的建筑，市政厅本身便是其中之一。","img":null,"src":null},{"name":"圣母圣名教堂","orig":"Crkva imena Marijinog","intro":"建于1892至1894年间的天主教堂，是诺维萨德最大的哥特复兴式教堂，也是巴奇卡地区最高的教堂。位于主广场市政厅对面，当地人称之为“大教堂”。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/62/Name_of_Mary_church_in_Novi_Sad_%285%29.jpg/960px-Name_of_Mary_church_in_Novi_Sad_%285%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1799},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Name_of_Mary_Church"},{"name":"法西斯主义受害者纪念碑","orig":"Spomenik žrtvama racije","intro":"立于多瑙河畔步道旁的小广场上，为纪念二战期间突袭的遇难者而建。1942年1月21日至23日，匈牙利警察杀害了1246名市民，其中超过800名犹太人，并将尸体抛入冰冷的多瑙河。这里可以眺望彼得罗瓦拉丁要塞。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d1/Spomenik_%C5%BDrtvama_racije%2C_Novi_Sad.jpg/960px-Spomenik_%C5%BDrtvama_racije%2C_Novi_Sad.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1440},"src":null},{"name":"圣乔治主教座堂","orig":"Saborni hram Svetog velikomučenika Georgija","intro":"塞尔维亚正教会巴奇卡教区的主教座堂，位于Nikole Pašića街4号。东正教是塞尔维亚的主要宗教，这座教堂是城市宗教生活的核心建筑之一。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/50/Serbia-0290_-_Orthodox_Cathedral_of_Saint_George.jpg/960px-Serbia-0290_-_Orthodox_Cathedral_of_Saint_George.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1390},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%81%96%E5%96%AC%E6%B2%BB%E4%B8%BB%E6%95%99%E5%BA%A7%E5%A0%82_(%E8%AB%BE%E7%B6%AD%E8%96%A9%E5%BE%B7)"}],"foods":[{"name":"鱼汤","orig":"riblji paprikaš","intro":"一种辛辣的炖鱼汤，是伏伊伏丁那地区的代表性菜肴。通常在传统的kafana或郊区农场餐厅（salaši）里能吃到。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b3/Hal%C3%A1szl%C3%A9.jpg/960px-Hal%C3%A1szl%C3%A9.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":531},"src":null},{"name":"萨尔玛","orig":"sarma","intro":"用酸菜叶包裹肉末和米饭炖煮而成的菜肴。附近的Futog村以出产Futoški kupus（Futog卷心菜）闻名，传统上被用来制作这道菜。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f9/Yaprak_sarma%2C_Kayseri_style.jpg/960px-Yaprak_sarma%2C_Kayseri_style.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stuffed_leaves"},{"name":"古拉什","orig":"gulaš","intro":"一种以肉类、蔬菜和辣椒粉炖制而成的浓汤，反映了当地饮食中匈牙利的影响。在诺维萨德的传统餐厅里常见。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5c/Gulyas080.jpg/960px-Gulyas080.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8F%A4%E6%8B%89%E4%BB%80"},{"name":"Index三明治","orig":"Index sandwich","intro":"诺维萨德特有的一种快餐，最初是为大学生创造的。适合快速解决一餐，在城市里容易找到。","img":null,"src":null}],"hero":[{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f5/Petrovaradin_Fortress_%28P%C3%A9terv%C3%A1radi_v%C3%A1r%2C_Peterwardein%29.JPG/1280px-Petrovaradin_Fortress_%28P%C3%A9terv%C3%A1radi_v%C3%A1r%2C_Peterwardein%29.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":496},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/40/Vladi%C4%8Danski_dvor_-_panoramio_%281%29.jpg/1280px-Vladi%C4%8Danski_dvor_-_panoramio_%281%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":960}],"outline":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[19.7639858,45.2300763],[19.8016148,45.2244357],[19.8077476,45.2222931],[19.8129152,45.2231535],[19.8133267,45.2212565],[19.8325906,45.2253145],[19.846597,45.2318299],[19.8568715,45.2394209],[19.8592074,45.2421494],[19.8602092,45.2454773],[19.8569379,45.2572439],[19.8590206,45.2605123],[19.8643271,45.2634726],[19.8676576,45.2641457],[19.8743859,45.2636441],[19.884304,45.2612085],[19.9118448,45.2498484],[19.9161955,45.2463809],[19.9221121,45.2488109],[19.9230322,45.2481323],[19.9283714,45.2532046],[19.9312518,45.2574478],[19.9314437,45.2629809],[19.9296166,45.2666732],[19.9186048,45.2709549],[19.9169287,45.2767319],[19.9069491,45.289392],[19.8971284,45.2934213],[19.8799299,45.2943418],[19.8756238,45.2967479],[19.8697986,45.3082915],[19.8654652,45.3085836],[19.8632165,45.3141335],[19.8595584,45.3170186],[19.8402701,45.321896],[19.8369604,45.3208942],[19.833788,45.3185068],[19.830608,45.3102772],[19.8299275,45.311463],[19.8288723,45.3109241],[19.8297352,45.3117126],[19.8286958,45.3174315],[19.820894,45.3139589],[19.8189773,45.3121115],[19.8104545,45.3180779],[19.8011715,45.3170239],[19.8010613,45.3053221],[19.7959636,45.3047442],[19.7955755,45.3026715],[19.7857727,45.298162],[19.7839136,45.2960243],[19.7832363,45.2938485],[19.7882512,45.2873715],[19.7857304,45.2804824],[19.7799969,45.2815197],[19.7678035,45.270791],[19.7818892,45.2629818],[19.7778811,45.2601409],[19.7843705,45.2529131],[19.7847227,45.2475706],[19.7875875,45.2432302],[19.77791,45.2436702],[19.7747284,45.244918],[19.7740233,45.2416047],[19.7655361,45.233423],[19.7639858,45.2300763]]]},"credit":{"model":"deepseek-v4-pro","wiki":{"zh":"诺维萨德","en":"Novi Sad","voyage":"Novi Sad"}}}